d flushed out momentum traders, forcing long‑only funds to reassess position sizes after a multiyear run.” — Benzinga, 2026-04-10 17:50 UTC, https://www.benzinga.com/trading-ideas/movers/26/04/51761068/servicenow-stock-craters-19-in-weeks-worst-sp-500", "origin": "writer_assembly", "provisional": true, "writer_stream_id": "stream:8c2ba2d33e8d46f1b605fc7b48f22b16"}, "run_id": "8c2ba2d33e8d46f1b605fc7b48f22b16", "schema_version": "v1", "sequence": 11, "stage": "STREAMING_ANSWER"}
